{"type":"Feature","id":"55FB407F5A00009C","properties":{"layer":"Famous Shootings","name":"DirtyPerry Lil Yummy","description":"09-01-1994\n\nRobert \"Lil Yummy\" Sandifer was shot & killed by Black Disciples who lured him to under the tracks to kill him. \n\nBlack Disciples leaders had Lil Yummy killed because 3 days earlier Lil Yummy was ordered by some Black Disciple leaders to kill some rivals but he killed a 14 year old girl & shot a few others. Beacuse the girl died the leaders were worried he would talk to the cops about the organization if interrogated so they had him killed.\n\nThis case made nationwide news & Time Magazine because he was so young & his own gang had him killed in such a fucked up way.","summary":"09-01-1994 · Robert \"Lil Yummy\" Sandifer was shot & killed by Black Disciples who lured him to under the tracks to kill him. · Black Disciples leaders had Lil Yummy killed because 3 days earlier Lil Yummy was ordered by some Black Disciple leaders to kill some rivals but he killed a 14 year old girl & shot a few others. Beacuse the girl died the leaders were worried he would talk to the cops about the organization if interrogated so they had him killed. · This case made nationwide news & Time Magazine because he was so young & his own gang had him killed in such a fucked up way.","nearest_trauma_center":"The University Of Chicago Medical Center","nearest_trauma_level":"Level I","nearest_trauma_km":10.02,"nearest_trauma_miles":6.23,"nearest_level1_center":"The University Of Chicago Medical Center","nearest_level1_km":10.02,"nearest_level1_miles":6.23},"geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[-87.609239,41.698248]}}
